  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:360px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-mediumvioletred pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Tactile Absorbing Replication</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/88/Adam_Sharp_01.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250526001553\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Adam Sharp 01\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/88/Adam_Sharp_01.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20250526001553\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/88/Adam_Sharp_01.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20250526001553 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/8/88/Adam_Sharp_01.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250526001553 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Adam Sharp 01\" width=\"270\" height=\"373\" data-image-key=\"Adam_Sharp_01.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Adam Sharp 01.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Chimera (DC Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Personally absorb and replicate whatever's at hand.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>assimilate all one experiences physically.</b> Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorptive_Entity_Access\" title=\"Absorptive Entity Access\">Absorptive Entity Access</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Codification\" title=\"Codification\">Codification</a>. Opposite to <a href=\"/wiki/Remote_Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Remote Absorbing Replication\">Remote Absorbing Replication</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTactile_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Direct Assimilation</li>\n<li>Formulative Omni-Morph Duplication</li>\n<li>Ultimate Glutton</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTactile_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A user can physically subsume anything and everything into themselves via direct contact, even going so far as to affect anything connected to it, be it adjacently or remotely connected.  \n</p><p>One can assimilate anything and everything around oneself via up-close and personal contact while steadily gaining insight into everything that makes it truly special and unique. At the same time, one takes on those properties and utilizes them for one's personal benefit. Such a power, while limited by contact, can be circumvented by remotely drawing in anything bound to it on a personal level, eliminating the worry of time, distance or relativity to whatever subject one is incorporating. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTactile_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Absorbing Replication\">Absorbing Replication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Attribute_Assimilation\" title=\"Adaptive Attribute Assimilation\">Adaptive Attribute Assimilation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Regeneration\" title=\"Mass Regeneration\">Mass Regeneration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Bio-Absorbing Replication\">Bio-Absorbing Replication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Biophysical_Possession\" title=\"Biophysical Possession\">Biophysical Possession</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Infection\" title=\"Assimilative Infection\">Assimilative Infection</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Factory\" title=\"Living Factory\">Living Factory</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Laboratory\" title=\"Living Laboratory\">Living Laboratory</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Arsenal\" title=\"Living Arsenal\">Living Arsenal</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Control_Manipulation\" title=\"Control Manipulation\">Control Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Evolving_Power_Replication\" title=\"Evolving Power Replication\">Evolving Power Replication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Superpower_Manipulation\" title=\"Personal Superpower Manipulation\">Personal Superpower Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Domination\" title=\"Domination\">Domination</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Effect_Extension\" title=\"Effect Extension\">Effect Extension</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Interface_Creation\" title=\"Interface Creation\">Interface Creation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Interface\" title=\"Personal Interface\">Personal Interface</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Genre-Shifting\" title=\"Genre-Shifting\">Genre-Shifting</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype_Adaptation\" title=\"Archetype Adaptation\">Archetype Adaptation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lower_Consciousness\" title=\"Lower Consciousness\">Lower Consciousness</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dispersed_Mind\" title=\"Dispersed Mind\">Dispersed Mind</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Supremacy\" title=\"Self-Supremacy\">Self-Supremacy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Mastery\" title=\"Self-Mastery\">Self-Mastery</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Quantum_Perception\" title=\"Quantum Perception\">Quantum Perception</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nemesis_Cloning\" title=\"Nemesis Cloning\">Nemesis Cloning</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Amalgamorphing\" title=\"Amalgamorphing\">Amalgamorphing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptation_Infusion\" title=\"Adaptation Infusion\">Adaptation Infusion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shapeshifting_Inducement\" title=\"Shapeshifting Inducement\">Shapeshifting Inducement</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Perfect_Doppelg%C3%A4nger\" title=\"Perfect Doppelgänger\">Perfect Doppelgänger</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Experience_Mimicry\" title=\"Experience Mimicry\">Experience Mimicry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omnireplication\" title=\"Omnireplication\">Omnireplication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shifting\" title=\"Shifting\">Shifting</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Replication\" title=\"Assimilative Replication\">Assimilative Replication</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Symbiosis\" title=\"Symbiosis\">Symbiosis</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Selective_Connection\" title=\"Selective Connection\">Selective Connection</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Solipsistic_Manipulation\" title=\"Solipsistic Manipulation\">Solipsistic Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tactical_Analysis\" title=\"Tactical Analysis\">Tactical Analysis</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_Reading\" title=\"Status Reading\">Status Reading</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Information_Analysis\" title=\"Information Analysis\">Information Analysis</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Fantastic-Matter\" title=\"Personal Fantastic-Matter\">Personal Fantastic-Matter</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Element_Manipulation\" title=\"Fantastic-Element Manipulation\">Fantastic-Element Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Fantastic-Energy Manipulation\">Fantastic-Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fantastic-Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Fantastic-Matter Manipulation\">Fantastic-Matter Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Transcendent_Symbiote_Physiology\" title=\"Transcendent Symbiote Physiology\">Transcendent Symbiote</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Transcendent_Parasite_Physiology\" title=\"Transcendent Parasite Physiology\">Parasite Physiology</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Parasite_Symbiosis\" title=\"Parasite Symbiosis\">Parasite Symbiosis</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Microorganism_Manipulation\" title=\"Microorganism Manipulation\">Microorganism Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Infestation\" title=\"Infestation\">Infestation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Symbiote\" title=\"Personal Symbiote\">Self Symbiosis</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Entity\" title=\"Personal Entity\">Personal Entity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Soul\" title=\"Personal Soul\">Personal Soul</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superorganism_Manipulation\" title=\"Superorganism Manipulation\">Superorganism Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptation_Infusion\" title=\"Adaptation Infusion\">Adaptation Infusion</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTactile_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Infection\" title=\"Assimilative Infection\">Assimilative Infection</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Replication\" title=\"Assimilative Replication\">Assimilative Replication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Evolution\" title=\"Assimilative Evolution\">Assimilative Evolution</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Boundless_Influence\" title=\"Boundless Influence\">Boundless Influence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Creation-Destruction_Lordship\" title=\"Creation-Destruction Lordship\">Creation-Destruction Lordship</a> - breaking down and reforming within for assimilation</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Existential_Plane_Connection\" title=\"Existential Plane Connection\">Existential Plane Connection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Force_Mimicry\" title=\"Force Mimicry\">Force Mimicry</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Change\" title=\"Absolute Change\">Absolute Change</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intuitive_Intelligence\" title=\"Intuitive Intelligence\">Intuitive Intelligence</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Claircognizance\" title=\"Claircognizance\">Claircognizance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Database\" title=\"Living Database\">Living Database</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Claircognizance\" title=\"Claircognizance\">Claircognizance</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Omnilegence\" title=\"Omnilegence\">Omnilegence</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Parasitic_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Parasitic Force Manipulation\">Parasitic</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Symbiotic Force Manipulation\">Symbiotic Force Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Absorption\">Absolute Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Exoskeleton_Modules\" title=\"Exoskeleton Modules\">Exoskeleton Modules</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Source_Manipulation\" title=\"Power Source Manipulation\">Power Source Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Energy_Signature_Manipulation\" title=\"Personal Energy Signature Manipulation\">Self Energy Signature</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Symbiont_Collective\" title=\"Symbiont Collective\">Symbiont Collective</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Structure_Merging\" title=\"Structure Merging\">Structure Merging</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTactile_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorptive_Entity_Access\" title=\"Absorptive Entity Access\">Absorptive Entity Access</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Control_Manipulation\" title=\"Control Manipulation\">Control Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Direct_Technoforming\" title=\"Direct Technoforming\">Direct Technoforming</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Replication\" title=\"Replication\">Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sufficiency\" title=\"Self-Sufficiency\">Self-Sufficiency</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTactile_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Might be a limit to how much one can readily absorb.</li>\n<li>Could obstruct absorption via protective insulator.</li>\n<li class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTactile_Absorbing_Replication%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Agreggor (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li>Kevin Levin (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li>Aaroniero Arruruerie (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li>Adam Sharpe/Chimera (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Klaramarians (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Jenova (<i>Final Fantasy VII</i>)</li>\n<li>Carl Creel/Absorbing Man (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Dungeon Warden (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>David Banner (<i>Marvel Comics</i>); Film version Hulk 2003</li>\n<li>Jerry Sledge/Stonewall (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Absolute Carnage (<i>TMNT</i>)</li>\n<li>Neo (<i>Toriko</i>)</li>\n<li>Grunge (<i>Wildstorm Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Videos\">Videos</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTactile_Absorbing_Replication%3Fve